{"id":"015ee65edd2df406","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-vper-directed-union.md","title":"有向PER族的上确界就是并","display":"thm-vper-directed-union — 有向PER族的上确界就是并","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-vper-directed-union","aliases":["72-thm-vper-directed-union"],"display":"thm-vper-directed-union — 有向PER族的上确界就是并","depends_on":["[[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X directed-union method in type-system construction; local member-PER lemma","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-vper-directed-union"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-vper-directed-union</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vper-directed-union — 有向PER族的上确界就是并"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d782aac0c1a67b9\" href=\"?note=9d782aac0c1a67b9\" title=\"72-df-vper-lattice-operations\">72-df-vper-lattice-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X directed-union method in type-system construction; local member-PER lemma"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d782aac0c1a67b9\" href=\"?note=9d782aac0c1a67b9\" title=\"72-df-vper-lattice-operations\">72-df-vper-lattice-operations</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R,S\\in\\mathcal K\\ \\exists U\\in\\mathcal K\\ (R\\cup S\\subseteq U)\">\\(\\forall R,S\\in\\mathcal K\\ \\exists U\\in\\mathcal K\\ (R\\cup S\\subseteq U)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup\\mathcal K\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e),\\qquad\n\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K=\\bigcup\\mathcal K.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigcup\\mathcal K\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e),\\qquad\n\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K=\\bigcup\\mathcal K.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对称和饱和由包含给定边的某个成员继承。传递的两条边可能属于不同成员，有向性给同时包含它们的 U，其传递性补出第三边。故并已是值相容 PER，也是最小关系上界，于是等于生成上确界。关键是有向性，而不是“族中每个成员已经传递”本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-vper-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"9d782aac0c1a67b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-vper-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"9d782aac0c1a67b9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}$ 取 [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]；$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，且 $\\forall R,S\\in\\mathcal K\\ \\exists U\\in\\mathcal K\\ (R\\cup S\\subseteq U)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall R,S\\in\\mathcal K\\ \\exists U\\in\\mathcal K\\ (R\\cup S\\subseteq U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup\\mathcal K\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e),\\qquad\n\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K=\\bigcup\\mathcal K.","display":true}],"bytes":1494,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"}],"outgoing":["9d782aac0c1a67b9"]}